===Etymology===
The first book with the character was [[w:The Mystery of Dr. Fu-Manchu|The Mystery of Dr. Fu-Manchu]], from 1913.

From the fictional character of [[w:Fu Manchu|Fu Manchu]], who was often depicted with such a style of moustache on film.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[series]] of [[book]]s by British author Sax Rohmer about a [[villain]] that sports a [[Fu Manchu moustache]], and other media based on them, such as [[comic book]]s and [[movie]]s.
# The villain who is the [[title character]] of that series.

